RigForge preset animations
==========================

The motion data in clips.json was derived from the CMU Graphics Lab Motion
Capture Database (http://mocap.cs.cmu.edu), using the BVH conversion by
Bruce Hahne (cgspeed), and retargeted to the RigForge canonical humanoid.

The data used in this project was obtained from mocap.cs.cmu.edu.
The database was created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.

CMU places no restrictions on the use of the original dataset: it is free
for research and commercial use (including in commercially sold products),
but the motion data itself may not be resold, even in converted form.

The build scripts in this package are MIT licensed (see the repository LICENSE).
